    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.",
